  <item>
    <title>EP8｜2024年终总结：我们终于学会了“爱自己”！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67732d6c1e823e72d3088b1c</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67732d6c1e823e72d3088b1c</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 31 Dec 2024 01:31:57 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>主播：不二君</span></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾&amp;副播：Stella</span></p><span></span><p><span>Bonne fin d'année 2024</span></p><span></span><p><span>Bonne nouvelle année 2025</span></p><span></span><p><span>⏰时间轴（AI嘻嘻）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="72">00:01:12</a> 展望2024，两位主播以独特视角开启了这场关于成长的对谈</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="215">00:03:35</a> 走进女性意识觉醒的历程，重新审视自己与世界的关系</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="416">00:06:56</a> 深入内心世界，探索自我认知的奥秘</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="547">00:09:07</a> 在回归中寻找力量，与过去的自己和解</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="748">00:12:28</a> Stella的英国文化之旅，开启了不一样的视野</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="804">00:13:24</a> 在苏格兰与藏族文化的交汇处，感受多元文明的魅力</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="888">00:14:48</a> 漫步大英博物馆，与古老文明展开对话</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="997">00:16:37</a> 从古文明的智慧中，思考科技与人性的平衡</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2072">00:34:32</a> 意大利之旅带来的深刻感悟，重新定义友情的真谛</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2509">00:41:49</a> 以当代女性的视角，探讨现实中的困境与突破</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2654">00:44:14</a> 在变化中保持乐观，这是生命给予我们的智慧</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2983">00:49:43</a> 从《接触》这部科幻电影中，读懂人性的光辉</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4140">01:09:00</a> 独处也是一种能力，学会与自己相处的艺术</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4304">01:11:44</a> 在爱与成长中，寻找最真实的自己</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4493">01:14:53</a> 与小猫Maymay相处，体悟陪伴的珍贵</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5032">01:23:52</a> 生命的轮回告诉我们，学会接纳是最大的智慧</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5218">01:26:58</a> 以历史为镜，让古人的智慧照亮现代生活</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lqh-trWhLVE1O41LCDAJeBdX2qeY.m4a" length="89353707" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:32:04</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fj6SE86iBEkfYSWYLRmjxD8C2D2P.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
